

PROJECT TITLE
LEGALEASE – AI-POWERED LEGAL DOCUMENT GENERATOR

1. PROJECT PLANNING OVERVIEW

The project is planned through different stages, from model selection and core development to testing and deployment.

2. PHASE 1 – MODEL SELECTION

• Analyze the requirements of legal document generation.
• Evaluate the capabilities of available AI models.
• Select Google Gemini 1.5 Pro for legal document generation.

3. PHASE 2 – CORE DEVELOPMENT

• Develop the backend generation logic.
• Create structured prompts.
• Validate user inputs.
• Connect the application with the Gemini AI core.

4. PHASE 3 – DOCUMENT FORMATTING

• Convert generated AI text into DOCX format.
• Generate PDF documents.
• Provide HTML preview.
• Apply professional formatting.

5. PHASE 4 – FRONTEND DEVELOPMENT

• Develop the Streamlit user interface.
• Add input fields.
• Provide editing features.
• Add document download options.

6. PHASE 5 – DEPLOYMENT

• Prepare production dependencies.
• Configure frontend and backend hosting.
• Prepare the application for cloud deployment.

7. PHASE 6 – TESTING AND QUALITY ASSURANCE

• Test different user inputs.
• Check document generation.
• Validate Gemini API integration.
• Test edge cases and network conditions.

8. PROJECT MILESTONES

• Model Selection
• Core Development
• Frontend Implementation
• Document Formatting
• Deployment
• Testing and QA
